From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 19:47:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] Add modern Exp. Share key item (default ON)

EXP. SHARE becomes a registrable key item given at the start of a new
game. Using it (from the bag or via SELECT) toggles
FLAG_SYS_EXP_SHARE_DISABLED (repurposed unused FLAG_0x8E0), so the
feature is ON by default.

While ON, Cmd_getexp gives every participant the full EXP. yield (no
splitting) and every other non-egg party member half, with one summary
message for the bench. While OFF, vanilla Gen 3 distribution applies.
The Route 15 aide now rewards a LUCKY EGG instead of a second Exp. Share.

Also: running shoes from the start and B-dash allowed in buildings and
caves (IsRunningDisallowed ignores the map allowRunning flag).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EDbdFFZUtxJmCbg3V6KwVM
